    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 12 Ashgrove Lawn is an excellent three-bedroom semi-detached residence, ideally situated in this mature, established and popular residential development in Carrigaline. Built c. 1983, this attractive home has been recently redecorated and benefits from a comprehensive range of modern upgrades including new windows throughout and a contemporary new bathroom. \r\n\r\nFurther enhancing the property's appeal is the installation of a 12-panel solar PV system with hot water diverter, contributing to the home's impressive B3 BER rating and offering improved energy efficiency for modern family living. \r\n\r\nThe property is presented in excellent condition throughout, providing bright, comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation that is ready for immediate occupation\r\n\r\n**Joint selling agents with Irish & European (021) 427 7606**"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - \r\nLaminate Timber Flooring, Fitted Recess Understairs Storage. \r\n\r\nSitting Room - 3.37m x 3.45m \r\nLaminate Timber Flooring, Fitted Blind, Corniced Ceiling.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room - 3.58m x 5.58m \r\nLaminate Timber Flooring, Fitted Blind, Built in Floor and Eye Level Kitchen Units with Wooden Counter Top. Tiled Splash Back, Marble Fireplace with Timber Surround, Fitted Solid Fuel Stove, Double Doors to Patio and Rear Garden \r\n\r\nStairs and Landing - \r\nFitted Carpet, Hot Press (Lagged and Shelved)\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.05m x 4.33m \r\nFitted Carpet, Fitted Blind, Built In Wardrobe \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.43m x 3.42m \r\nFitted Carpet, Fitted Blind, Built In Wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.26m x 2.65m \r\nLaminate Timber Flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom - \r\nFully Tiled Flooring and Bath Surround, WC, Bath with Electric Shower, Wash Hand Basin with Fitted Storage and Tiled Splash Back.\r\n\r\nAttic Space - \r\nPartially Floored Storage Space, Fitted Stira Fold Away Stairs\r\n\r\nOutside - \r\nThe property is approached via a private front driveway, providing valuable off-street parking and mature front lawn. To the rear is a particularly appealing fully enclosed, mature and private garden, complemented by a patio area. The established planting and enclosed nature of the garden provide an excellent outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining and family enjoyment. There is an external power point to the rear of the residence and electricity connected to the garden shed to the rear of the garden. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent Condition throughout\r\nRecently Redecorated to High Standard\r\nTwelve Panel Solar PV System with Hot Water Diverter Installed\r\nB3 BER Rating\r\nOff-Street Driveway Parking\r\nFully Enclosed, Mature and Private Rear Garden & Patio Area\r\n\r\nServices : \r\nMains Water.\r\nMains Sewage.\r\nElectricity Connection.\r\nRefuse Collection.\r\nBroadband Connection."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "No. 12 Ashgrove Lawn enjoys an excellent position within this well-established and mature residential area of Carrigaline, offering the ideal combination of a peaceful suburban setting and excellent everyday convenience.\r\nSituated on the north side of Carrigaline town center, the property is accessed from the town center by heading north along the Main Street and upon reaching the roundabout (with church on right) take the second exit. Proceed straight along Cork Road and at next Roundabout, take third Exit (to Right). Proceed straight for c. 150 m nd turn left into Ashgrove, follow road and take first turning to right. Property is located on Right.\r\n\r\nThis location is well serviced by the No 220 Bus Route to and from Cork City Center. Bus Stops are found nearby."
      }
    ],
